    "summary": {
     "type": "rendered",
     "raw": "This PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Change | [Age](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) | [Confidence](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| [net.bytebuddy:byte-buddy-agent](https://bytebuddy.net) ([source](https://github.com/raphw/byte-buddy)) | `1.18.15-jdk5` → `1.18.16-jdk5` | ![age](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/age/maven/net.bytebuddy:byte-buddy-agent/1.18.16-jdk5?slim=true) | ![confidence](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/confidence/maven/net.bytebuddy:byte-buddy-agent/1.18.15-jdk5/1.18.16-jdk5?slim=true) |\n\nHave a look at your [dependency dashboard](https://statlas.prod.atl-paas.net/renovate-dashboards/atlassian/bamboo-specs.html)\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n\n**raphw/byte-buddy (net.bytebuddy:byte-buddy-agent)**\n\n### [`v1.18.16`](https://github.com/raphw/byte-buddy/blob/HEAD/release-notes.md#23-October-2026-version-11816)\n\n- Correct detection of a dropped implicit `this` frame in constructors with `long` or `double` parameters when using `Advice`.\n- Detect a dropped uninitialized `this` frame in constructors after full frames when using `Advice` with copied arguments.\n- Update ASM to version 9.11.1 and the ASM to Class File API bridge to version 0.0.14.\n- Use a valid tag for the Gradle plugin portal.\n\n\n\n---\n\n### Configuration\n\n📅 **Schedule**: (UTC)\n\n- Branch creation\n  - At any time (no schedule defined)\n- Automerge\n  - At any time (no schedule defined)\n\n🚦 **Automerge**: Disabled by config. Please merge this manually once you are satisfied.\n\n♻ **Rebasing**: Whenever PR becomes conflicted, or by renaming this PR to start with \"rebase!\".\n\n🔕 **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update again.\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Mend Renovate](https://github.com/renovatebot/renovate).",
     "markup": "markdown",
     "html": "<p>This PR contains the following updates:</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Package</th>\n<th>Change</th>\n<th><a data-is-external-link=\"true\" href=\"https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Age</a></th>\n<th><a data-is-external-link=\"true\" href=\"https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Confidence</a></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a data-is-external-link=\"true\" href=\"https://bytebuddy.net\" rel=\"nofollow\">net.bytebuddy:byte-buddy-agent</a> (<a data-is-external-link=\"true\" href=\"https://github.com/raphw/byte-buddy\" rel=\"nofollow\">source</a>)</td>\n<td><code>1.18.15-jdk5</code> → <code>1.18.16-jdk5</code></td>\n<td><img alt=\"age\" src=\"https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/age/maven/net.bytebuddy:byte-buddy-agent/1.18.16-jdk5?slim=true\"></td>\n<td><img alt=\"confidence\" src=\"https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/confidence/maven/net.bytebuddy:byte-buddy-agent/1.18.15-jdk5/1.18.16-jdk5?slim=true\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Have a look at your <a data-is-external-link=\"true\" href=\"https://statlas.prod.atl-paas.net/renovate-dashboards/atlassian/bamboo-specs.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">dependency dashboard</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"markdown-header-release-notes\">Release Notes</h3>\n<p><strong>raphw/byte-buddy (net.bytebuddy:byte-buddy-agent)</strong></p>\n<h3 id=\"markdown-header-v11816\"><a data-is-external-link=\"true\" href=\"https://github.com/raphw/byte-buddy/blob/HEAD/release-notes.md#23-October-2026-version-11816\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code>v1.18.16</code></a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Correct detection of a dropped implicit <code>this</code> frame in constructors with <code>long</code> or <code>double</code> parameters when using <code>Advice</code>.</li>\n<li>Detect a dropped uninitialized <code>this</code> frame in constructors after full frames when using <code>Advice</code> with copied arguments.</li>\n<li>Update ASM to version 9.11.1 and the ASM to Class File API bridge to version 0.0.14.</li>\n<li>Use a valid tag for the Gradle plugin portal.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"markdown-header-configuration\">Configuration</h3>\n<p>📅 <strong>Schedule</strong>: (UTC)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Branch creation</li>\n<li>At any time (no schedule defined)</li>\n<li>Automerge</li>\n<li>At any time (no schedule defined)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>🚦 <strong>Automerge</strong>: Disabled by config. Please merge this manually once you are satisfied.</p>\n<p>♻ <strong>Rebasing</strong>: Whenever PR becomes conflicted, or by renaming this PR to start with \"rebase!\".</p>\n<p>🔕 <strong>Ignore</strong>: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update again.</p>\n<hr>\n<p>This PR has been generated by <a data-is-external-link=\"true\" href=\"https://github.com/renovatebot/renovate\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mend Renovate</a>.</p>"
